---
import { site } from "@/data/site";
---

<section id="why" class="wrap">
  <div class="bg-ink px-6 py-16 text-white sm:px-12 lg:px-20 lg:py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow text-white/70">Why Genesyx · The idea in 20 seconds</p>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr] lg:items-end">
      <h2 class="display-md !text-white">
        Shettles is the theory. <span class="text-pink">Genesyx is how you follow it.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/80">
        The theory proposes that vaginal environment and intercourse timing may favour X- or
        Y-bearing sperm. Genesyx coordinates the moving parts in one programme.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="relative mt-16">
      <div
        class="absolute top-0 right-0 left-0 hidden h-0.5 bg-linear-to-r from-pink via-lavender-soft to-aqua sm:block"
        aria-hidden="true"
      ></div>
      <ol class="grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-0">
        <li class="relative sm:border-r sm:border-white/15 sm:pt-6 sm:pr-8">
          <span class="absolute -top-1.5 left-0 hidden size-3 rounded-full border-2 border-pink bg-ink sm:block"></span>
          <p class="eyebrow text-[0.625rem] text-white/60">01 / Prepare</p>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 56 28" class="mt-8 h-7" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect
              x="2"
              y="4"
              width="30"
              height="16"
              rx="8"
              transform="rotate(-20 17 12)"
              fill="#DDA4D3"
            ></rect>
            <rect
              x="24"
              y="8"
              width="30"
              height="16"
              rx="8"
              transform="rotate(20 39 16)"
              fill="#8DD2E2"
            ></rect>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl !text-white">Diet + formula</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/70">XX- or XY-specific preparation.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="relative sm:border-r sm:border-white/15 sm:px-8 sm:pt-6">
          <span class="absolute -top-1.5 left-8 hidden size-3 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-ink sm:block"></span>
          <p class="eyebrow text-[0.625rem] text-white/60">02 / Check</p>
          <div class="mt-8 flex h-7 items-center gap-3" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold">pH</span>
            <span class="relative h-1 w-32 rounded-full bg-linear-to-r from-pink to-aqua">
              <span class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/3 size-3 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full border-2 border-ink bg-white"></span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl !text-white">Vaginal pH</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/70">At-home readings instead of guesswork.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="relative sm:pt-6 sm:pl-8">
          <span class="absolute -top-1.5 left-8 hidden size-3 rounded-full border-2 border-aqua bg-ink sm:block"></span>
          <p class="eyebrow text-[0.625rem] text-white/60">03 / Align</p>
          <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="grid size-9 place-items-center rounded-full bg-lavender text-[0.625rem] font-semibold">
              XX
            </span>
            <span class="h-px w-10 bg-white/30"></span>
            <span class="grid size-9 place-items-center rounded-full bg-lavender text-[0.625rem] font-semibold">
              XY
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl !text-white">Cycle + timing</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/70">Signals brought together in the companion app.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-14 border-t border-white/15 pt-6 text-xs text-white/60">{site.disclaimer}</p>
  </div>
</section>
